cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FaceFuel in your research, please cite the papers below."
title: "FaceFuel: tri-modal visual wellness screening from face, eye and tongue photos"
type: software
version: 4.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
license-url: "https://polyformproject.org/licenses/strict/1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/M-O-J-U/FaceFuel"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that combines face, eye and tongue computer-vision pipelines
  (YOLO11m detection, DINOv2 region features, Monte Carlo dropout severity models)
  with product-of-experts fusion to point to nutrition and lifestyle areas worth a
  closer look. A wellness-awareness tool, not a medical device.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - multimodal fusion
  - digital health
  - tongue diagnosis
  - nutritional screening
